content.text:
Now p6: game state, entities, waves, physics, collisions, powerups, scoring, drain, endGame, startGame, loadScores etc. loadScores referenced in p5 but not defined yet — function declaration hoisted if in same IIFE; yes define in p6 as function declaration.

Let me define:

```js
let balls=[],bumpers=[],zombies=[],powerups=[],parts=[],pops=[],decals=[];
const WALLS=[...];
const flips={L:{...},R:{...}};
const effect={bomb:0, bigUntil:0}; // per-ball power maybe
```

Flipper state:
```js
const flips={
  L:{px:98,py:606,len:70,rest:0.38,up:-0.42,angle:0.38,hold:false,minUntil:0},
  R:{px:277,py:606,len:70,rest:Math.PI-0.38,up:Math.PI+0.42,angle:Math.PI-0.38,hold:false,minUntil:0}
};
```
Update in updatePlay.

Walls with funnel additions:
```js
const WALLS=[
 [16,92,16,596],
 [359,92,359,596],
 [16,92,70,58],
 [70,58,305,58],
 [305,58,359,92],
 [16,566,58,606],
 [359,566,317,606],
];
```
Hmm the funnel walls endpoints at 58,606 and 317,606; flipper pivots at 98/277, lengths 70. Left flipper at rest tip at 98+cos(.38)*70=163.2, y=606+sin(.38)*70=632. Right tip 277-65.2=211.8. Gap 48. Good. Funnel wall end (58,606) to pivot 98 gap 40; ball could slip through into outlane. Fine.

Ball spawn at (W/2, H-104=563). That's just above funnel endpoints and between flippers. Good.

`startGame()`:
```js
function startGame(){
  ensureAudio();
  G.state='play';
  G.score=0; G.wave=1; G.lives=cfg().lives; G.combo=0; G.comboT=0;
  G.slowUntil=0; G.shake=0; G.rank=0; G.best=loadScores()[0]?.score||0;
  balls=[];bumpers=[];zombies=[];powerups=[];parts=[];pops=[];decals=[];
  setupWave();
  spawnBall();
  G.banner='WELLE 1'; G.bannerSub='EINSATZ BEGINNT'; G.bannerUntil=performance.now()+1800;
  SFX.wave();
}
```

`setupWave()`:
- bumpers, zombies.
- Ensure positions not too close to ball spawn.
- Layout array with jitter per wave.
- zombies count.

`spawnBall()`:
- push ball object, G.serving true, G.charge 0, G.charging false, G.serveAt=now.
- If extra balls from multiball? Multiball adds balls directly, not via spawnBall.
- On respawn after life loss, clears old balls? ballDead removes/leave; set balls=[] then spawnBall.

`launchBall(power)`:
- find serving; set vy = -(8.5 + 7*power); vx rand; serving false; G.serving=false; G.charging=false; SFX; steam particles; trail.
- If charge pointer still down, ignore.

`updateGame(dt)`:
- now.
- slow factor = now<G.slowUntil ? 0.45 : 1.
